  "summary": "typst-resume-cli exfiltrates host and environment data to an AWS Lambda endpoint on execution",
  "details": "index.js imports https, http, and child_process, reads process.env and process.platform, and issues an https.request to the hardcoded endpoint https://oo7fsr4cy32q42bzkpgwhy7asu0hzaod.lambda-url.us-east-1.on.aws (index.js:23,86). The code combines environment/host reconnaissance with a POST to a hardcoded attacker-controlled AWS Lambda URL that is unrelated to any documented resume/typst functionality, matching the credential and environment exfiltration pattern.",
